<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Newsletter | SNPN</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <style>
        /* --- Newsletter Specific Styles --- */
        
        /* Hero Banner */
        .newsletter-hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-blue, #0A2F5D) 0%, #061e3e 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 80px 8%;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 4px solid var(--accent-blue, #5bc0de);
        }

        .newsletter-hero h1 {
            font-size: 42px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .newsletter-hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Subscription Section */
        .subscribe-section {
            padding: -50px 8% 60px; /* Negative top padding to pull it up into the banner */
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
            margin-top: -40px;
        }

        .subscribe-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 800px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        .subscribe-card h3 {
            color: var(--primary-blue, #0A2F5D);
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .subscribe-card p {
            color: var(--text-gray, #64748b);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .subscribe-form {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .subscribe-form input {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 200px;
            padding: 14px 20px;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-family: inherit;
        }

        .subscribe-form input:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--accent-blue, #5bc0de);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(91, 192, 222, 0.2);
        }

        .subscribe-btn {
            padding: 14px 30px;
            background-color: var(--accent-blue, #5bc0de);
            color: #ffffff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .subscribe-btn:hover {
            background-color: #46a8c6;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .success-message {
            display: none;
            background-color: #ecfdf5;
            color: #065f46;
            border: 1px solid #a7f3d0;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* Archive Grid */
        .archive-section {
            padding: 40px 8% 80px;
            background-color: var(--bg-light, #f8fafc);
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 32px;
            color: var(--primary-blue, #0A2F5D);
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .archive-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .issue-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            border-top: 4px solid transparent;
        }

        .issue-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            border-top-color: var(--accent-blue, #5bc0de);
        }

        .issue-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .issue-tag {
            background: #e0f2fe;
            color: #0369a1;
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .issue-date {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .issue-card h4 {
            font-size: 20px;
            color: var(--primary-blue, #0A2F5D);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .issue-card p {
            color: var(--text-gray, #64748b);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .read-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            color: var(--accent-blue, #5bc0de);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 15px;
            transition: gap 0.3s ease;
        }

        .read-btn:hover {
            gap: 12px; /* Smooth arrow slide effect */
            color: var(--primary-blue, #0A2F5D);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <section class="newsletter-hero">
        <h1>SNPN Quarterly Newsletter</h1>
        <p>Stay informed with the latest breakthroughs in neuroendocrinology, society announcements, grant opportunities, and upcoming national conferences.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="subscribe-section">
        <div class="subscribe-card">
            <h3>Subscribe to Our Mailing List</h3>
            <p>Join our digital network. We promise to only send you high-quality scientific updates.</p>
            
            <form id="newsletter-form" class="subscribe-form">
                <input type="text" id="sub-name" placeholder="Full Name" required>
                <input type="email" id="sub-email" placeholder="Email Address" required>
                <button type="submit" class="subscribe-btn">Subscribe Now</button>
            </form>
            
            <div id="subscribe-success" class="success-message">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Thank you, <span id="display-sub-name"></span>! You have been successfully added to our mailing list.
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="archive-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Newsletter Archives</h2>
        
        <div class="archive-grid">
            
            <div class="issue-card">
                <div class="issue-header">
                    <span class="issue-tag">Vol 4, Issue 1</span>
                    <span class="issue-date">March 2026</span>
                </div>
                <h4>Spring Symposium Highlights & Early Career Grants</h4>
                <p>Read the comprehensive summary of our spring gathering, featuring keynote abstracts and new grant opportunities for postdoctoral fellows.</p>
                <a href="#" class="read-btn">Read Issue <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
            </div>

            <div class="issue-card">
                <div class="issue-header">
                    <span class="issue-tag">Vol 3, Issue 4</span>
                    <span class="issue-date">December 2025</span>
                </div>
                <h4>Year in Review: Breakthroughs in Neuropeptides</h4>
                <p>A look back at the most cited papers from our society members this year, plus announcements for the upcoming executive council elections.</p>
                <a href="#" class="read-btn">Read Issue <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
            </div>

            <div class="issue-card">
                <div class="issue-header">
                    <span class="issue-tag">Vol 3, Issue 3</span>
                    <span class="issue-date">September 2025</span>
                </div>
                <h4>Industry Collaboration & New Diagnostics</h4>
                <p>Exploring the bridge between academic research and industry applications. Featuring an interview with our lead industry partners.</p>
                <a href="#" class="read-btn">Read Issue <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

    <script>
        document.getElementById('newsletter-form').addEventListener('submit', function(event) {
            event.preventDefault(); // Prevent page reload
            
            // Get user input
            const subName = document.getElementById('sub-name').value;
            
            // Hide the form visually to show success state
            this.style.display = 'none';
            
            // Populate and reveal success message
            document.getElementById('display-sub-name').innerText = subName;
            document.getElementById('subscribe-success').style.display = 'block';
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>